  memorizing. The strength of recurrent priors for learning         nally the coda C, which un-embeds from latent space using
  complex algorithms has already been demonstrated in the           several layers and also contains the prediction head of the
  “deep thinking” literature (Schwarzschild et al., 2021b;          model. The core block is set between the prelude and coda
  Bansal et al., 2022; Schwarzschild et al., 2023).                 blocks, and by looping the core we can put an indefinite
                                                                    amount of verses in our song.

